graph TD
    %% Synchronization
    Heli[Heli: Solar Day Pulse] -.->|Tick| ResonAgents
    Heli -.->|Tick| ECS

    %% Source
    Input[Sculpting Lab / HOPquery] -->|Raw Instruction| Agent1

    %% The Trinity of ResonAgents
    subgraph ResonAgents [Trinity of resonAgents]
        Agent1[Agent 1: Orgo/Structural Synthesizer]
        Agent2[Agent 2: Gelle/Adaptive Weaver]
        Agent3[Agent 3: exoCue/Relational Architect]
    end

    %% Processing
    Agent1 -->|Validated Contracts| ECS
    Agent2 -->|Validated Contracts| ECS
    Agent3 -->|Constraint Graph| ECS

    %% Execution Fabric
    subgraph ExecutionFabric [safeflow-ecs]
        ECS[Constraint & Coherence Engine]
    end

    %% Feedback & Emulation
    ECS -->|Coherent Ledger State| DS[BentoBoxDS Emulation]
    DS -->|Peer Input/Mutation| Input

    style ExecutionFabric fill:#1a1a1a,stroke:#00ffc8,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style ResonAgents fill:#fdfcfb,stroke:#00796b
    style Heli fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#fbc02d